			"date": "2021-11-12T18:23:00.000Z",
			"content": "Authentication on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\">@eleven_ty</a> from <a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\">@zachleat</a>.\n\nThis is great! 11ty is great because it's built for the simplest use cases out of the box.\n\nBut that can give it the appearance of being limited. Examples like this really showcase just how powerful it can be.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/eleventy-login/\">zachleat.com/web/eleventy-l…</a>",
