			"date": "2021-11-16T10:41:25.000Z",
			"content": "Nice, in this video <a href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\">@zachleat</a> shows how the OAuth dance can be performed with our favourite programming language, HTML, and some Netlify function magic (no client-side JavaScript 🕺) <a href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/web/eleventy-login/\">zachleat.com/web/eleventy-l…</a>",
